WEBVTT

00:16:57.537 --> 00:17:03.787
But seek out critics who who consistently
have opinions that mirror your own

00:17:03.787 --> 00:17:05.538
right. If you love a movie,

00:17:05.663 --> 00:17:09.788
go find a critic who felt similarly to
you that wrote about the movie in

00:17:09.788 --> 00:17:13.413
a way that you found compelling and go
see what else they liked. Right.

00:17:13.663 --> 00:17:18.329
Because odds are you will find other
movies that you will be intrigued by.

00:17:18.329 --> 00:17:22.538
And then you can be the critic that shares
information about those movies

00:17:22.538 --> 00:17:24.163
with other people in your community.

00:17:25.288 --> 00:17:29.038
And I know that sounds like a very
elaborate thing to do in order to find

00:17:29.038 --> 00:17:31.788
a good movie or television show.
But I promise you two things.